      "text": "\n## Price and accommodation\n\n| Option | USD |\n| --- | ---: |\n| 2 PAX DBL | 6994 |\n\nThe rate is for two travellers sharing a double room. The package includes accommodation with breakfast (BB) and services as per the programme.\n\n| Days | Hotel | Room and meals | Nights |\n| --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| 1–2 | Novotel Santiago Providencia | Standard Room, BB | 1 |\n| 2–4 | Hotel Kimal | Standard Room, BB | 2 |\n| 4–5 | Novotel Santiago Providencia | Standard Room, BB | 1 |\n| 5–7 | El Puesto Patagonia | Standard Room, BB | 2 |\n| 7–9 | Hotel Altiplanico Puerto Natales | Standard Room, BB | 2 |\n\n",
